आख्यानपरिप्रश्नयोश्च — The affix इञ् optionally applies after a root when question (परिप्रश्न) and answer (आख्यान) are expressed (along with ण्वुल् and other affixes).

@note[In the compound आख्यानपरिप्रश्न, the logical order is inverted — आख्यान comes first because words with fewer syllables precede in compounds (per @ref[2.2.34]).]

The च draws in ण्वुल् from the previous sūtra.
